<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces continue a month-long siege of Taiz while Yemeni government troops have seized the al-Jawf mountain range, intensifying front-line fighting. Houthi rockets damaged the Saudi Aramco tower in Riyadh and the Saudi-led coalition intercepted a cruise missile, a long-range anti-tank guided missile and downed a ballistic missile aimed at Medina. A Saudi strike near Sanaa killed 22 civilians, mostly women and children, and a Houthi-claimed airstrike near the capital also killed 22 people. Saudi officials inspected Aramco facilities after Houthi damage, filmed strikes on Houthi missile production sites, and reported that the vital East-West pipeline was hit, while Pakistan condemned the attacks and Syria announced troops to Saudi Arabia. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/07/world/middleeast/more-than-50-killed-in-yemen.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168730&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOalZ4eXZJUXo2UF83X3ZqSXcyTWNXeHFRcnUyWGNtSmVDT29EWkQyWnUzSndVdDN0UU9LS0xPbS00WXl1ZnpZSm5jSFNqMy1jd1dISEZiTUVrNUQwVEFZbjEzcXBwUzdnYTB2YkNZVDFBMTZGdllLRWJKQTFPVVloTkxqVmxESUxqUi1iZ3B5SnlYVjVXdnlvMzhvZjQ2Uk9XNExNS0tqTDlDX002bnhmZzdYMFVDR1pFbkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWG5LTUxZQkN4RUk0WVNQdXM0LXZCbzAzUjc0T2FLXzAta0xwdHo3OWpNS3VsLTRaOHpGcEQxN1piZ25IR1NuU0pzNU5MTndzQzVybUs2Q193VGpCZl9IYnE0US1yU0RBQjZUZS1IRmtHNjZpSVUzZEM4R1JxUWotYWlYczc5SmpseWdLZm50Yl9hTVNEMTJScWdLekFTdC1rS241NHZpQnAwTmdrN2xQMFZDcmIydTFXRk1LMGtSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Time